t inferred from test PASS.',unresolved=['The selected runtime crate requires its own trusted compilation preparation; build failures are not protocol results.'])),monitors=[dict(id='monitor-notify-identity',checker_id='notify-identity',event='completion',binding_ids=binding,admission_alias='admitted',grounding=g(['s-rt-api-contract','s-rt-assignment','s-runtime-drain','s-storage-load-read'],'Observe the return of the exact append_notify future that generated the captured tagged EntryId; independently read the decided entry at the returned position. Error outcomes are allowed by the implication. Missing completion remains unknown.',expectation_ids=['s-rt-api-contract','s-rt-error-contract'],binding_ids=binding),applicability_conditions=[])],observable_properties=[dict(checker_id='notify-identity',kind='event_implication',identity_fields=['op_id'],trigger=dict(field='event',value='completion'),antecedent=dict(field='success',value=True),assertion=dict(field='observed_value',reference='admitted.proposed'),description='If this admitted append_notify returns Ok, the actual decided value at that returned position equals the proposed value. A different replacement value is forbidden; Timeout/Superseded does not violate the condition.')],uncertainties=['Only one fixed delayed-assignment history, no exhaustive interleavings or durability claims.','Bounded pending is not a liveness violation and does not count as a completed comparison.','New crate preparation may expose compilation prerequisites; semantic attribution requires current checker correspondence after execution.'])\njson.dump(p,open('delayed-assignment-plan.json','w'),indent=2)\ns=dict(action='check',unit_id='unit-claim-notify-same-entry',rationale='Execute the accepted completion-identity obligation with an actual delayed assignment, replacement decision and independent public read; do not infer failure from the source ordering.',plan_path='delayed-assignment-plan.json',harness_path='delayed_assignment.rs',source